[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
This development snapshot provides the native CPU Mojo compiler, standard
library, language server, formatter, C FFI and Python 3.12 importer on amd64 FreeBSD 16 / 5BSD.
The tested CPU configuration is x86-64-v3.

GPU execution, the MAX SDK, the Mojo debugger and REPL are not
included. This port uses its own pinned LLVM/MLIR sources;
it does not require replacing base LLVM.

Examples are installed under share/examples/mojo when EXAMPLES is enabled.
See the ports tree's README.mojo.5BSD for qualification status and limitations.
EOM
}
]
